.TH DANBY-DISEASEBIRTHDEATH2 1
.SH NAME
danby-diseasebirthdeath2 \- epidemic with independent vital rates and virulence
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B danby/diseasebirthdeath2
.SH MODEL
N=S+I+R;
S' = bN-beta SI/N-mu S;
I' = beta SI/N-(gamma+mu+alpha)I;
R' = gamma I-mu R.
.PP
Birth b and natural death mu need not balance, and alpha is additional
disease mortality.  Consequently N'=(b-mu)N-alpha I and population size is a
model result, not a fixed normalization.  Frequency-dependent incidence keeps
the contact interpretation meaningful as N changes.
.SH CONTROLS
Drag a compartment bar.  Tracks set contact, recovery, birth, natural death,
and virulence.  Space pauses, period steps, r resets, and q exits.
.SH NUMERICS
The regression suite checks the stated total-population balance directly.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/danby/plugin/diseasebirthdeath2.b
.br
.B /appl/danby/diseasebirthdeath2.b
